{"id": "3687187126", "title": "记一次RTEMS系统的固件解密", "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI1MDQ5MzA4NA==&mid=2247484079&idx=1&sn=8b8fb5144b612b10af544b8eb26ec6b0", "accountName": "胖猴实验室", "author": "胖猴实验室", "date": "5月31日", "ts": 1685529000000, "cover": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/16mq5V01bbhgq7YSwSicJYp5rMTfwqVlOjvRTDk0PJhmuDcWMOFmiazLCFXxFRzFsYdjmibBUAU9IupwRBSBbsFvA/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "summary": "原创 Light & Yimi Hu 2023-05-31 18:30 北京 \n本文主要介绍了RTEMS系统的解密过程\n1 \n前言 \n‍ 各位，好久不见，在这篇文章中，我们打算分享一款门禁考勤机设备，这款门禁考勤机原本是两年前提交给geekpwn的展示项目之一，但由于一些原因，我们提前退赛了，很遗憾，没能和大家在杭州多玩几天。 考虑到相关设备的漏洞已经提交了快两年了，想必该修复的也修复了，设备可能", "content": [{"type": "p", "text": "原创 Light & Yimi Hu 2023-05-31 18:30 北京"}, {"type": "p", "text": "本文主要介绍了RTEMS系统的解密过程"}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/16mq5V01bbhgq7YSwSicJYp5rMTfwqVlOjvRTDk0PJhmuDcWMOFmiazLCFXxFRzFsYdjmibBUAU9IupwRBSBbsFvA/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "caption": "", "_imgCount": 1}, {"type": "p", "text": "前言"}, {"type": "p", "text": "PS：本次分享讨论的是固件可以提取但是无法分析的情况，一些由于读保护机制导致固件不被提取的情况，暂不在本篇的讨论范畴中。"}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/16mq5V01bbhgq7YSwSicJYp5rMTfwqVlOfiaBafIiay1xgZWxrJXcWsZqouauW4icNNptPo22MYsFdibxNtQBd9hxiag/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": 2}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/16mq5V01bbhgq7YSwSicJYp5rMTfwqVlOWgFZsCX30x5fjYHddFcDFsUVkuJiaP9qbT2yXjmlLJmJkiaibXpGrzMtw/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": 3}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/16mq5V01bbhgq7YSwSicJYp5rMTfwqVlOlWIEHg3WLt13LOCiaGtrU2Urbic7kOQyEEvjjprIUv4nkEwHBiaQibSvSA/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": 4}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/16mq5V01bbhgq7YSwSicJYp5rMTfwqVlO7doDXZUm77icVHE06VYzicBSy7JwN6yxw8ejPI3I3joJOicTL1eXB6LEA/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": 5}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/16mq5V01bbhgq7YSwSicJYp5rMTfwqVlOSdMrBialCDyJkySP499ibbQ7BQzrs51UgQaq1zSRgbHEPMrEHxcHdMqg/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": 6}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/16mq5V01bbhgq7YSwSicJYp5rMTfwqVlOqCUJNBUwTTcfbGbiajStJ8lnxxHaORgYHqY3d17PwUHGRzekkarxrVQ/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": 7}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/16mq5V01bbhgq7YSwSicJYp5rMTfwqVlOU2RBDRlXDiaGiaYEibOrSfjACpVMIdLpX4PMDQk9DibPDxiaZVugg2YlmoA/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": 8}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/16mq5V01bbhgq7YSwSicJYp5rMTfwqVlOTfSAWNRU9uvY06NwxIFC73bHK4dGdBk5pQc1cBer4TyBCgmtCg19jA/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": 9}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/16mq5V01bbhgq7YSwSicJYp5rMTfwqVlORExfMkpj668ibibaNCBJWkQaMjgQL9BSBtjcCmibBNic0b4AJ1HmtcZ80g/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": 10}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/16mq5V01bbhgq7YSwSicJYp5rMTfwqVlOZ4VUvLkMHqSdz0Z5JZ8zLiaoooK06OcplcicHE5J175HwXEicljR8icj8Q/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": 11}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/16mq5V01bbhgq7YSwSicJYp5rMTfwqVlOVenJgBzBzuIbnuJF3icARghIYiae4hBnOAZpaiccNSPmVdBKYmfvKvDhQ/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": 12}, {"type": "p", "text": "到此， bootloader 和 kernel 部分可以告一段落了，在开始分析 APP 之前，还有一点需要提一下，与传统 PC 操作系统不同的是，该设备并不存在用户态和内核态， kernel 和 app 处于相同的特权级别，所以两者之间可以直接相互调用，不需要上下文的切换。"}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/16mq5V01bbhgq7YSwSicJYp5rMTfwqVlOxBJ03yDQzmlkjtkNdbeYFaJDYyQqicIrCnakicWhWOCSRVKWJ6FrvuTA/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": 13}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/16mq5V01bbhgq7YSwSicJYp5rMTfwqVlOjDg9SQEEL1TnPk4XbojCHw5MwF8AzVSl9RrsGrSUa46ttGOmUyxDcQ/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": 14}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/16mq5V01bbhgq7YSwSicJYp5rMTfwqVlOAMVdtdv9p4VfkGUMeKicAxI9YJaVtqBibCoGrZLcS9vb7KtxiaXfY5Yew/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": 15}, {"type": "p", "text": "跳转微信打开"}], "body": 